{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 6, :comments ["לא ידע אתו מאומה — in the house." "כי אם הלחם אשר הוא אוכל — he did not investigate or look at all into any of the needs of his household, where they came from, until the hour when he saw his food upon the table and ate it. He calls every kind of food לחם, as written: ״עבד לחם רב״. And likewise: ״כי לפני לחמי אנחתי תבוא״ — my foods." "לא ידע אתו — of all the needs of his household he saw nothing except at the time of eating."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 39, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:46:43.270250146Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}